5,1,1,talk,Midori,,We need to know who is accountable when things break.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The depot floor cannot stop for a software project.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I am worried about systems that age quietly in place.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Our team is thin; we cannot afford a chaotic rollout.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The headline price is a lie. I care about the long tail.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If the plan drifts, who fixes it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
