12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I agree. Hidden costs are a trap.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, and the people who have to learn it.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, yes. The bill arrives after the applause.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,Let's look at the support history and the scope changes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the depot calendar and the yard devices.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
