18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I need to know about the retirements and the supervisors.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will pull the board minutes and the renewal invoices.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. Let's see what the paper says.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The floor is the truth.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
