35,2,1,talk,Midori,,The last outage was unowned for two days. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We tried a cutover in peak season and lost two days.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. It is rotting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The last hire took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Capital is cut, but operating costs pass easily. The trap is set.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that explains why we keep buying add-ons.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, the yard scanners are a mess. We need stability.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the trainers leave, the knowledge leaves too.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the supervisors already ignored the last rollout.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, the scope never survives a year. We need flexibility.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need a vendor who owns the whole thing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,It must work with our old hardware and tight calendar.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,No more external teams fumbling with our data.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a partner who stays and trains us properly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I want a fixed cost structure. No surprise renewals.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,A single point of contact is essential.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,And it must be robust enough for the yard.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,And it must not age out of date in two years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,And it must respect the people we have.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"And it must be affordable over ten years, not just one.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
