60,3,1,talk,Midori,,Meridian offers a regional team. That solves the ownership gap.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Anchor is built for transport. It fits our specific needs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Tessera has a marketplace. It might avoid the aging problem.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Corvus is modular. We can replace parts without a full overhaul.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Meridian's fixed configuration might keep costs predictable.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, but is it flexible enough for our rule changes?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, a marketplace sounds nice, but who maintains it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, Anchor is on-premise. We have the skills for that.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, Meridian's regional team might be too far away.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
