70,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am leaning towards Meridian. The support model is clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I prefer Anchor. It is built for us, not adapted to us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I am wary of Tessera. The data lift in 2018 was a disaster.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about Corvus. Too many moving parts for our team.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am voting for Meridian. The cost structure is the most stable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Midori,,Let's go with Meridian. It addresses the accountability issue.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I can live with Meridian if the hardware is compatible.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,Meridian seems the safest bet against hidden costs.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I hope the regional team is responsive.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,It is the only one that doesn't look like a money pit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
